/target

# testdata/*.parquet is generated, not tracked — the repo-wide .gitignore
# excludes *.parquet, and these are reproduced byte-for-byte by
# `cargo run --bin riff-fixtures`. Starting without them fails with a message
# naming that command.
/testdata

# The production sample slice IS committed — 128K of real catalog rows that
# keep the e2e tests honest about prod's actual schemas and encodings.
!/tests/prod-sample/*.parquet
